ial signals / 6 AM26C31IPWR banks. New electrical scope; current firmware remains six-channel." (at 17.78 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "509bc07a-9481-5ae7-9140-cac546542a9e")) (text "Engineering circuit only.\nAll twelve channels populated.\n8-channel population needs\nseparate BOM and export.\nNo price or speed approval." (at 700 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "034bcf24-ae33-5dc7-9f7d-326d3d52b16c")) (text "JLOGIC1 is an internal boundary.\n3.3V logic; no 5V GPIO pullups.\nNo inputs driven with VCC off.\nSix enable pulldowns in parallel.\nTX_PERMIT requires >=2V high.\nNo line protection or PCB yet.\nNo automatic receiver fail state.\nDrive enables/alarms separate." (at 700 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc1e907d-d797-51fd-97c5-a262d63c3e9b")) (text "TX_PERMIT low makes differential outputs HIGH-Z. A remote drive may interpret floating lines incorrectly; receiver bias and independent drive inhibit need qualification.\n1.2A reservation on CORE_5V is a conservative design allowance, not a measured load. Existing six-channel converter budget cannot be reused without recalculation.\nTwelve motor channels are not twelve Cartesian axes. No gateware expansion, cable qualification, thermal proof or manufacturing release follows from this drawing." (at 17.78 535.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "372afa7c-2ee9-50bd-bc10-0882ab98f03d")) (text "Source: TI AM26C31 SLLS103P, pin Table4-1, operating Section5.3, electrical Section5.5, function Table7-1.\nInput33R damping,10k defaults, capacitor MPNs, connector selections and final protection remain open." (at 17.78 564 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "293361e7-3df5-564e-ada3-d18f75eaf401")))
